r titles had you leading humans against alien invaders; here you defend the alien homeworld against a human counterattack.\n\nTower defense moves quickly here: enemy soldiers shoot back at your towers, so you need to watch the battlefield and counterattack. Eight upgradable towers come with special abilities such as repairs, berserk mode and sacrificial explosions, and at the start of each campaign you tailor the tech tree to your needs. Developed by 11 bit studios, it is a single-player game for tower defense fans who like to stay busy."}}